{"id":"2f9e8362ed1dce1d","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-halt.md","title":"一般停机关系","display":"df-halt — 一般停机关系","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-halt","aliases":["20-df-halt"],"display":"df-halt — 一般停机关系","chapter":"1","section":"1.6","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Definition 1.6.6","source_pdf_pages":[50],"source_printed_pages":[14],"depends_on":["[[20-df-numbering]]","[[20-df-pairing]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-halt"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-halt</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-halt — 一般停机关系"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"section","html":"1.6"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 1.6.6"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>50</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dc642dd12c05d028\" href=\"?note=dc642dd12c05d028\" title=\"20-df-numbering\">20-df-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e,x\\in\\omega\">\\(e,x\\in\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"dc642dd12c05d028\" href=\"?note=dc642dd12c05d028\" title=\"20-df-numbering\">20-df-numbering</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}halt}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{HALT}:=\\{(e,x)\\in\\omega^2:\\varphi_e(x)\\downarrow\\},\\qquad\nH:=\\{\\langle e,x\\rangle:(e,x)\\in\\mathrm{HALT}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}halt}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{HALT}:=\\{(e,x)\\in\\omega^2:\\varphi_e(x)\\downarrow\\},\\qquad\nH:=\\{\\langle e,x\\rangle:(e,x)\\in\\mathrm{HALT}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保持旧 HALT 的有序对类型，同时显式给出自然数编码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span>；本书的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_0\">\\(K_0\\)</span> 使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle x,e\\rangle\">\\(\\langle x,e\\rangle\\)</span>，只是配对坐标次序不同，计算可同构。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 1.6.6；印刷页 14；PDF 第 50 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"dc642dd12c05d028","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"35073b74f84433b3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-pairing]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"dc642dd12c05d028","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"35073b74f84433b3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"e,x\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}halt}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{HALT}:=\\{(e,x)\\in\\omega^2:\\varphi_e(x)\\downarrow\\},\\qquad\nH:=\\{\\langle e,x\\rangle:(e,x)\\in\\mathrm{HALT}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"H","display":false},{"tex":"K_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle x,e\\rangle","display":false}],"bytes":997,"backlinks":[{"id":"4033dacb4f25ad78","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-K]]；see [[20-df-halt]]；see [[20-df-k1-con]]；see [[20-thm-K-one-complete]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]；see [[20-lem-padding]]；see [[20-thm-myhill-isomorphism]]。"},{"id":"1f0d77daa9699532","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-sacks-splitting]]；see [[20-prop-disjoint-ce-join]]；see [[20-df-halt]]；see [[20-df-redeg]]；see [[20-thm-jump]]；see [[20-df-low-high]]。"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-43","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-halt]] — 章 1；直接提供者 2 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-43","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-halt]]"}],"outgoing":["dc642dd12c05d028","35073b74f84433b3"]}